Z||000010||fiero56||10-25-2000||10:26 PM||||If you want some really good stuff, go to the library, and check out:<BR>"Comeback: The Fall and Rise of the American Automobile Industry". Quite a few pages go into great detail on the great Fiero experiment, full of details, and history, and the story behind the car. I definitely recommend everyone read this book. It is great reading.||||reg||1
